.* The menus.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJOB KEYL=WJKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Job
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT1' OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101'.Display job status attributes
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Display job definition attributes
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103'.Display job run attributes, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104'.Work with spooled files
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110'.Display job log, if active, on job queue, or pending
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='RETURN 111'.Display call stack, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='RETURN 112'.Work with locks, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT13' OPTION=13 ACTION='RETURN 113'.Display library list, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT14' OPTION=14 ACTION='RETURN 114'.Display open files, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT15' OPTION=15 ACTION='RETURN 115'.Display file overrides, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT16' OPTION=16 ACTION='RETURN 116'.Display commitment control status, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT17' OPTION=17 ACTION='RETURN 117'.Display communications status, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT18' OPTION=18 ACTION='RETURN 118'.Display activation groups, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT19' OPTION=19 ACTION='RETURN 119'.Display mutexes, if active
:MENUI HELP='WRKJOB/OPT20' OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120'.Work with threads, if active
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJOB KEYL=DJKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT1' OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101'.Display job status attributes
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Display job definition attributes
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103'.Display job run attributes, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104'.Display spooled files
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110'.Display job log, if active, on job queue, or pending
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='RETURN 111'.Display call stack, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='RETURN 112'.Display locks, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT13' OPTION=13 ACTION='RETURN 113'.Display library list, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT14' OPTION=14 ACTION='RETURN 114'.Display open files, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT15' OPTION=15 ACTION='RETURN 115'.Display file overrides, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT16' OPTION=16 ACTION='RETURN 116'.Display commitment control status, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT17' OPTION=17 ACTION='RETURN 117'.Display communications status, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT18' OPTION=18 ACTION='RETURN 118'.Display activation groups, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT19' OPTION=19 ACTION='RETURN 119'.Display mutexes, if active
:MENUI HELP='DSPJOB/OPT20' OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120'.Display threads, if active
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 1: status attributes.
:PANEL NAME=STSA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Status Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STATUS' VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status of job
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CURUSER' VAR=CURUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.Current user profile
:DATAI HELP='FLD/IDENTITY' VAR=IDENTITY USAGE=OUTPUT.Job user identity
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SETBY' VAR=SETBY USAGE=OUTPUT.Set by
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Entered system
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ENTDATE' VAR=ENTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ENTTIME' VAR=ENTTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Started
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STRDATE' VAR=STRDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STRTIME' VAR=STRTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SBS' VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SBSPOOL' VAR=SBSPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem pool ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TYPE' VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type of job
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SPCENV' VAR=SPCENV USAGE=OUTPUT.Special environment
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RTNCODE' VAR=RTNCODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Program return code
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNTRLD' VAR=CNTRLD USAGE=OUTPUT.Controlled end requested
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SYSPOOL' VAR=SYSPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT.System pool identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CPUMS' VAR=CPUMS USAGE=OUTPUT.Processing unit time used, in ms
:DATAI HELP='FLD/AUXIO' VAR=AUXIO USAGE=OUTPUT.Auxiliary I/O requests of the job
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 2: definition attributes.
:PANEL NAME=DFNA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Definition Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOBD' VAR=JOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job description
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOBDLIB' VAR=JOBDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOBQ' VAR=JOBQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Job queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOBQLIB' VAR=JOBQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOBPTY' VAR=JOBPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Job priority (on job queue)
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTPTY' VAR=OUTPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Output priority (on output queue)
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ENDSEV' VAR=ENDSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.End severity
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Message logging
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LOGLVL' VAR=LOGLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LOGSEV' VAR=LOGSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Severity
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LOGTXT' VAR=LOGTXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LOGCLPGM' VAR=LOGCLPGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Log CL program commands
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LOGOUT' VAR=LOGOUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Job log output
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRTDEV' VAR=PRTDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer device
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTQ' VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Default output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTQLIB' VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRTTXT' VAR=PRTTXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer text
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DATFMT' VAR=DATFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Date format
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DATSEP' VAR=DATSEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Date separator
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TIMSEP' VAR=TIMSEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Time separator
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DECFMT' VAR=DECFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Decimal format
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SWS' VAR=SWS USAGE=OUTPUT.Job switches
:DATAI HELP='FLD/INQMSG' VAR=INQMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Inquiry message reply
:DATAI HELP='FLD/BRKMSG' VAR=BRKMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Break message handling
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STSMSG' VAR=STSMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Status message
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DEVRCY' VAR=DEVRCY USAGE=OUTPUT.Device recovery action
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CCSID' VAR=CCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Coded character set identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DFTCCSID' VAR=DFTCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Default coded character set identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LANGID' VAR=LANGID USAGE=OUTPUT.Language identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNTRYID' VAR=CNTRYID USAGE=OUTPUT.Country or region identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRTSEQ' VAR=SRTSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sort sequence
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MSGQMX' VAR=MSGQMX USAGE=OUTPUT.Job message queue maximum size
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MSGQFL' VAR=MSGQFL USAGE=OUTPUT.Job message queue full action
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ALWMLT' VAR=ALWMLT USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow multiple threads
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SPLFACN' VAR=SPLFACN USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file action
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 3: run attributes.
:PANEL NAME=RUNA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Run Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RUNPTY' VAR=RUNPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Run priority
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TIMESLICE' VAR=TIMESLICE USAGE=OUTPUT.Time slice in milliseconds
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PURGE' VAR=PURGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Eligible for purge
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DFTWAIT' VAR=DFTWAIT USAGE=OUTPUT.Default wait time in seconds
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CPUTIME' VAR=CPUTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum CPU time in milliseconds
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CPUUSED' VAR=CPUUSED USAGE=OUTPUT.CPU time used
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MAXTMP' VAR=MAXTMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum temporary storage in megabytes
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TMPUSED' VAR=TMPUSED USAGE=OUTPUT.Temporary storage used
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TMPPEAK' VAR=TMPPEAK USAGE=OUTPUT.Peak temporary storage used
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MAXTHD' VAR=MAXTHD USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum threads
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/THREADS' VAR=THREADS USAGE=OUTPUT.Threads
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Thread resources affinity
:DATAI HELP='FLD/AFFGRP' VAR=AFFGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Group
:DATAI HELP='FLD/AFFLVL' VAR=AFFLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RSCAFF' VAR=RSCAFF USAGE=OUTPUT.Resources affinity group
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=CPUTHD USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Maximum processing unit time per thread
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 4: the job's spooled files.
:PANEL NAME=SPLF KEYL=SPLFKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1'.Work with Job Spooled Files
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=SPLF.(No spooled output files)
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?SNDNETSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.1=Send
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.3=Hold
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.6=Release
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 7'.7=Messages
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.8=Attributes
:LISTACT HELP='SPLF/OPTIONS' OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9'.9=Work with printing status
:LISTCOL HELP='SPLF/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/FILE' VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/DEVQ' VAR=DEVQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Device or Queue
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/USRDTA' VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User Data
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SPLSTS' VAR=SPLSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PAGES' VAR=PAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Total Pages
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/CURPAGE' VAR=CURPAGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Current Page
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/COPIES' VAR=COPIES USAGE=OUTPUT.Copies
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3 or command
:EPANEL.
.* Option 10 and DSPJOBLOG: the job log.
:PANEL NAME=JOBLOG KEYL=LOGKEYS HELP=JOBLOG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Log
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MSGS.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MSGLINE' VAR=MSGLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=JOBLOGALL KEYL=ALLKEYS HELP=JOBLOG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display All Messages
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MSGS.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MSGLINE' VAR=MSGLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 11: the call stack.
:PANEL NAME=CALLSTK KEYL=STKKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Call Stack
:DATA DEPTH=3 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/THREAD' VAR=THREAD USAGE=OUTPUT.Thread
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=STACK MAXHEAD=2.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RQSLVL' VAR=RQSLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PGM' VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Program
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PGMLIB' VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/STMT' VAR=STMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Statement
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PROC' VAR=PROC USAGE=OUTPUT.Procedure
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 13: the library list.
:PANEL NAME=LIBL KEYL=LIBLKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Library List
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LIBL.
:LISTACT HELP='LIBL/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.5=Display objects in library
:LISTCOL HELP='LIBL/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/LIB' VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/LIBTYPE' VAR=LIBTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTGRP.ASP
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/ASPDEV' VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/LIBTEXT' VAR=LIBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 14: the open files.
:PANEL NAME=OPNF KEYL=OPNFKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1'.Display Open Files
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ODPS' VAR=ODPS USAGE=OUTPUT.Number of open data paths
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OPNF.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OFILE' VAR=OFILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OLIB' VAR=OLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OMBR' VAR=OMBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Member/ Device
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OSCOPE' VAR=OSCOPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Scope
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OACTGRP' VAR=OACTGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Activation Group
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJOB.Job - Help
:P.One job: who it is, how it was defined and how it runs, its
spooled files, its job log, its call stack, its library list and the
files it has open. Type an option number and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=JOBLOG.Job log - Help
:P.The messages the job has logged, oldest first. A request typed at
a command line shows with the marks before it. F10 shows every
message, the detailed ones included.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WJKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOB'.Job
:P.The job, by name, user and number. A job name alone is enough when
only one job has it.
:EHELP.
